# row, class.gate.rowAbove points in the row above (that branch; a row above that holds fewer buyable points asks only those), and class
# level 5 per row (class.gate.levelFloor). gates() / gatesD() answer GN slots: a class tree's slot (branch x 8 + row) = 0 open / LOCKG
